На основе ТЗ составь детальный набор промптов для Bolt. Промпты должны быть четкие не более 10-13

Bolt
1) Modern B2B SaaS sales analytics dashboard.
   Desktop only (target 1440×900).
   Clean, professional, high information density, excellent readability.
   Use shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS.
   Prefer subtle borders, soft shadows, muted backgrounds.
   Primary accent: indigo / blue.
   Support light and dark mode.
   All numbers should be formatted nicely (currency, percentages, compact).

Create a full desktop dashboard layout for a Sales Performance Dashboard.

  Requirements:
  - Top header with logo/title "Sales Performance" and a period selector on the right.
  - Period selector must support:
    - Today
    - Last 7 days
    - Last 30 days
    - This month
    - Last month
    - Custom date range (from → to) with a calendar popover
  - Clean, modern SaaS style using shadcn/ui + Tailwind.
  - Target viewport 1440×900.
  - Soft background, subtle borders, good spacing.
  - The main content area should be ready to accept multiple sections (KPI cards, ranking, charts, tables).

  Make the period selector the primary control of the page.

  2)Create a row of 6 modern KPI cards for a sales analytics dashboard.

    Cards:
    1. Revenue
    2. Gross Profit
    3. Margin %
    4. Number of Sales
    5. Average Check
    6. Best Manager (name + value)

    Each card must show:
    - Title
    - Large main value
    - Small comparison to previous period (↑ / ↓ with percentage and absolute difference)
    - Subtle sparkline or trend indicator (optional but welcome)

    Style:
    - shadcn/ui cards
    - Clean typography
    - Good visual hierarchy
    - Hover effect
    - Skeleton loading state version of the same cards

    Use indigo/blue accent. Make numbers easy to scan.
3)Create a Managers Ranking section for a sales dashboard.

  Requirements:
  - Toggle between two ranking modes: "Gross Profit" and "Average Check"
  - Table or card list showing for each manager:
    - Rank position
    - Manager name + avatar/initials
    - Number of sales
    - Revenue
    - Gross Profit
    - Average Check
    - Margin %
    - Change vs previous period (↑↓ with color)
  - Highlight top-3 positions
  - Smooth re-ordering animation when switching sort mode
  - Empty state when no data
  - Loading skeleton

  Use shadcn/ui Table or a clean card list. Make it look premium and scannable.

  4)Create a time-series chart section for sales dynamics.
    Features:
    - Toggle between metrics: Revenue / Gross Profit / Number of Sales
    - Line or area chart (Recharts or Tremor style)
    - X-axis: dates
    - Tooltip with formatted values
    - Smooth transitions when changing metric or period
    - Loading skeleton
    - Empty state

    Style should match modern SaaS dashboards (clean grid, subtle colors, good typography).

5)Create two side-by-side sections:

  1. Sales / Profit by Categories
     - Horizontal bar chart or donut + legend
     - Show Revenue and Gross Profit share

  2. Top Products
     - Ranked list or small table
     - Product name, category, revenue, gross profit, margin

  Both sections should have:
  - Loading skeleton
  - Empty state
  - Clean modern look with shadcn/ui

  6)Create a "Recent Sales" table section.

    Columns:
    - Date
    - Manager (name + avatar)
    - Customer (name + company)
    - Products (summary or count)
    - Status (Paid / Cancelled / Refunded) — with colored badges
    - Amount (Revenue)
    - Gross Profit

    Features:
    - Pagination or "Load more"
    - Status badges with proper colors
    - Hover row effect
    - Loading skeleton
    - Empty state ("No sales in selected period")

    Use shadcn/ui Table. Make it dense but readable.

    7)Compose a complete Sales Performance Dashboard page using all the previous sections.

      Layout order (top → bottom):
      1. Header + Period Selector
      2. KPI Cards row (6 cards)
      3. Two-column section:
         - Left: Managers Ranking
         - Right: Dynamics Chart
      4. Two-column section:
         - Categories
         - Top Products
      5. Full-width Recent Sales table

      Global requirements:
      - All data is controlled by the selected period
      - Proper loading / error / empty states for every block
      - Subtle micro-animations (counters, chart transitions, ranking reorder)
      - Desktop only, 1440×900 target
      - shadcn/ui + Tailwind
      - Professional B2B SaaS aesthetic

